menu "Present LVGL benchmark"

    config APP_LVGL_BENCH_LOOP
        bool "Loop the runtime benchmark matrix"
        default n
        help
            Run the complete mode/rotation matrix repeatedly. When disabled,
            the benchmark runs the matrix once and then stops its worker task.

    config APP_LVGL_BENCH_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
        int "Timeout for each mode/rotation benchmark"
        range 70 600
        default 120
        help
            Maximum time allowed for LVGL's complete benchmark (currently
            about 69 seconds) and its final summary callback. Each matrix case
            advances as soon as the callback supplies the statistics.

endmenu
